-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/lyney/261111-225116/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"The First Great Magic","r":[0.1093,0.2478,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Astral Vulture's Crimson Plumage","r":[0.1093,0.3048,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Aqua Simulacra","r":[0.1093,0.3619,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Marechaussee Hunter","r":[0.0815,0.4722,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Lavawalker","r":[0.0815,0.5293,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Gladiator's Finale","r":[0.0815,0.5863,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Shimenawa's Reminiscence","r":[0.1296,0.5863,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Lyney","r":[0.0815,0.6926,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1231,0.6926,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kaedehara Kazuha","r":[0.1648,0.6926,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Zhongli","r":[0.2065,0.6926,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lyney","r":[0.0815,0.7496,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1231,0.7496,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1648,0.7496,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Zhongli","r":[0.2065,0.7496,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lyney","r":[0.0815,0.8067,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1231,0.8067,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.1648,0.8067,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Dehya","r":[0.2065,0.8067,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lyney","r":[0.0815,0.8578,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.1231,0.8578,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Xiangling","r":[0.1648,0.8578,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lynette","r":[0.2065,0.8578,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/lyney/261111-225116/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"The First Great Magic","text":"His signature adds CRIT DMG and Charged Attack damage. Multiple Pyro teammates grant ATK stacks that suit his favored teams. Strongest in teams with at least two Pyro characters."},{"name":"Astral Vulture's Crimson Plumage","text":"Huge CRIT DMG and Charged Attack buffs make it a premium alternative. Its passive favors a different elemental team setup. Value depends on activating its Charged Attack passive."},{"name":"Aqua Simulacra","text":"Its large CRIT DMG stat and nearby-enemy damage bonus boost his Prop Arrows and Skill without relying on reactions. Stay reasonably close to targets to activate its passive."},{"name":"Thundering Pulse","text":"Strong base ATK, CRIT DMG and ATK% are useful. Its Normal Attack bonus does not enhance Lyney’s Charged Attacks. Mostly a strong stat stick; Normal Attack stacks are not the goal."},{"name":"Skyward Harp","text":"High base ATK, CRIT Rate and bonus CRIT DMG provide reliable damage. Watch for CRIT Rate overcap with Marechaussee Hunter. Keep displayed CRIT Rate below about 64% with full Hunter stacks."},{"name":"Scion of the Blazing Sun","text":"A Charged Attack hit marks a target for extra damage, with an added Charged Attack bonus against that target. Most reliable against one marked enemy. Higher refinements strengthen its marked-target payoff."},{"name":"Song of Stillness","text":"Fontaine craftable with ATK% and a damage bonus after receiving healing. Bennett can activate it consistently. Bring reliable healing, preferably Bennett. R5 is a strong accessible goal."},{"name":"Prototype Crescent","text":"An ATK% bow that grants a major ATK boost after a Charged Attack hits an enemy weak point. Excellent when the passive works. Enemy must have a hittable weak point. R5 rewards consistent weak-point hits."}],"a":[{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"His Prop Arrows consume HP and his Skill heals, giving reliable access to 36% CRIT Rate plus 15% Charged Attack DMG.","stats":"ATK% · Pyro DMG · CRIT DMG"},{"names":["Lavawalker"],"text":"Boosts damage against Pyro-affected enemies. Works in Mono Pyro but is less consistent and generally weaker than Hunter.","stats":"ATK% · Pyro DMG · CRIT"},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","Shimenawa's Reminiscence"],"text":"Simple ATK% mix for an interim build while farming Hunter. Choose the pieces with the strongest CRIT stats.","stats":"ATK% · Pyro DMG · CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Final Curtain","members":["Lyney","Bennett","Kaedehara Kazuha","Zhongli"],"text":"Bennett heals, buffs ATK and keeps Pyro active. Kazuha Swirls Pyro for damage buffs and RES shred; Zhongli protects Lyney while he aims.","roles":["Main DPS","Healer / ATK Buff","Pyro Buff / Shred","Shield / RES Shred"]},{"name":"House of Flames","members":["Lyney","Bennett","Xiangling","Zhongli"],"text":"Xiangling adds strong off-field Pyro damage and helps maintain Pyro aura. Bennett powers both DPS units, while Zhongli guards charged shots.","roles":["On-field DPS","Healer / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Pyro Enabler","Shielder / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Smoke and Mirrors","members":["Lyney","Bennett","Sucrose","Dehya"],"text":"Dehya adds Pyro and interruption resistance; Bennett heals and buffs. Sucrose holds Viridescent Venerer and can pass Thrilling Tales ATK.","roles":["Main DPS","Healer / ATK Buff","VV / ATK Support","Interruption Resistance"]},{"name":"Budget Magic Show","members":["Lyney","Bennett","Xiangling","Lynette"],"text":"Bennett and Xiangling keep enemies burning with Pyro while Lynette shreds Pyro RES using Viridescent Venerer. Dodge carefully without a shield.","roles":["Main DPS","Healer / ATK Buff","Off-field Pyro DPS","VV / Anemo Support"]}],"v":"Mono Pyro Carry: Use Bennett plus another Pyro teammate to keep enemies affected by Pyro. Fire Prop Arrows, then spend Prop Surplus stacks with Skill.\nShielded Comfort: Zhongli or Dehya helps prevent interrupted Charged Attacks. Choose this when enemies attack aggressively.\nCraftable F2P: Use Song of Stillness with a healer such as Bennett, or Prototype Crescent when enemies expose weak points.\nNo Hunter Set Yet: Use Lavawalker against Pyro-affected foes or a 2-piece ATK mix until a good Marechaussee Hunter set is ready.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Lyney is an on-field Pyro DPS who fires Prop Arrows to summon Grin-Malkin Hats, then cashes in Prop Surplus stacks with his Skill. His HP changes make Marechaussee Hunter easy to activate. He shines against Pyro-affected enemies.","pros":["Powerful Charged Attacks","Strong single-target DMG","Self-activates Hunter set","Excellent Pyro synergy"],"cons":["Aiming takes practice","Vulnerable while charging","Wants reliable healing","Prefers persistent Pyro aura"],"weapons":["The First Great Magic","Astral Vulture's Crimson Plumage","Aqua Simulacra","Thundering Pulse","Skyward Harp","Scion of the Blazing Sun","Song of Stillness","Prototype Crescent"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Lavawalker"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Mono Pyro alternative"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","Shimenawa's Reminiscence"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Temporary mix"}],"main":["ATK%","Pyro DMG Bonus","CRIT DMG / CRIT Rate"],"stats":["CRIT Rate: 45% - 64% (Hunter)","CRIT DMG: 180% - 240%+","ATK: 1,800 - 2,300+","Energy Recharge: 100% - 150%"],"vars":[{"title":"Shielded Mono Pyro","role":"On-field Charged Attack DPS","weapons":["The First Great Magic","Aqua Simulacra","Song of Stillness"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Pyro DMG / CRIT. Aim for no more than 64% displayed CRIT Rate with full Hunter stacks.","teams":"Bennett plus a shield or interruption resistance source, with reliable Pyro aura.","when":"Best for dangerous enemies that interrupt aimed shots. Bennett heals and buffs; Zhongli or Dehya lets Lyney charge safely.","cond":"Prefer Pyro-affected enemies to maximize his Ascension 4 passive.","notes":"Lyney should land several Prop Arrows before using Skill to spend Prop Surplus stacks.","pre":false},{"title":"Offensive Mono Pyro","role":"On-field Charged Attack DPS","weapons":["The First Great Magic","Astral Vulture's Crimson Plumage","Thundering Pulse"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"CRIT DMG and ATK% after reaching practical CRIT Rate. ER matters more if bursting each rotation.","teams":"Bennett, another Pyro damage source, and Anemo RES shred; no guaranteed shield.","when":"For faster clears when dodging is 